   "slot": "dyn:complaint.testicular_or_scrotal_pain"
  },
  {
   "role": "bot",
   "text": "Thanks for letting me know it's your big toe. When did you last eat or drink anything, and what was it?",
   "ts": "2026-10-15 00:45:28",
   "kind": "question",
   "slot": "dyn:L.last_intake"
  },
  {
   "role": "caregiver",
   "text": "Dinner at 9pm last night was the last time I ate, a big seafood meal, and I had several beers with it. I haven't had anything since.",
